L2.G3 → I L2.G3_IUI_1             # జ ja: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G3_IUI_1 → U L2.G3_IUI_2       # జ ja: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G3_IUI_2 → I L2.G4             # జ ja: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G4
