L2.G5_UII_2 → I L2.G6             # భ bha: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G6
L2.G6 → U L2.G6_UIUNL_1           # ర ra: symbol 1/4 read, 3 to go
L2.G6_UIUNL_1 → I L2.G6_UIUNL_2   # ర ra: symbol 2/4 read, 2 to go
L2.G6_UIUNL_2 → U L2.G6_UIUNL_3   # ర ra: symbol 3/4 read, 1 to go
L2.G6_UIUNL_3 → ⏎ L3.G1           # ర ra: symbol 4/4, complete → L3.G1
L3.G1 → U L3.G1_UIU_1             # ర ra: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G1_UIU_1 → I L3.G1_UIU_2       # ర ra: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G1_UIU_2 → U L3.G2             # ర ra: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G2
L3.G2 → I L3.G2_IIU_1             # స sa: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
